Attached is a zip file containing a single page version of 
The Complete Lojban Language as seen:
http://lojban.github.io/cll/
Having everything on one page allows us to use our browser's
webpage text search (Ctrl+F) to easily find things.

I wrote a script that merges all the chapters/subsections into one html 
document 
and fixes the chapter/section/example links (using regex).
I also fixed the links in the table of contents (index.html).

Attached are two zip files. The only difference is one includes the chapter 
pictures.

How to use:
- Extract the folder from the zip file to anywhere you want.
- In the extracted folder, open "lojban.html" with your web browser.
- Bookmark it.

Enjoy! :D

-- 
